{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_029_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:687456108ccab22824dc91986dd6572a9e394a0d8c8334aca24647fc5163a521",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_029_22:5_02_029_22_a:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7cbadd98fb3ae68a80639565ed03380369ead137aa4bbef43978fa57fec3ad91",
      "text": "原来你在这里啊，吾主。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_029_22:5_02_029_22_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc01a91e89c4d9514544d35e6377ae7739e48529ee2dae92c7ea246bb64cfe54",
      "text": "今日乃不可忘却的，白之圣战！吾主啊，\n我已为你备好缠绕着地狱之暗的赠礼！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_029_22:5_02_029_22_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f974290217eea405120ee38e72109f544453c35cdaf739cf32a63cb4af8a05b3",
      "text": "此乃，我等奉上的一点微末谢意之证明。\n我与撒旦，皆深感于主之慈悲与关怀。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_029_22:5_02_029_22_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8c9782f03101e3883b2a22192042da6024f83bf513b6408fb5440f05d0f022a",
      "text": "若是能合主的审美品味就好了……\n不，定然是能合你心意的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_029_22:5_02_029_22_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32d93740b30500b780f92cfa8df1abce148f6ad27884c74d83b43116b06ecd33",
      "text": "再次呼唤吾主，今后亦与我等共赴霸道吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_029_22:5_02_029_22_b:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cbc0dc2cb6cfc680b38dbfcaf62da4c2e9142549a2938078ebf82c9ed394d26f",
      "text": "来了吗，吾主。\n我早已恭候汝之造访多时了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_029_22:5_02_029_22_b:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3dcb977e3ef8f643c4b36e2e0313ca4ef43bd79e8d14bc52fdc3f7d8c444adf5",
      "text": "今宵乃白之圣战。我特为此日\n备下了缠绕着漆黑之暗的赠礼！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_029_22:5_02_029_22_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75a4efe7db052fa2821cb820efefa2e697447cefecc1c2205fe320c4d7ed9af2",
      "text": "伴随着我与撒旦的谢意，\n还请务必收下此物。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_029_22:5_02_029_22_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b3687f10428607eff2b2d2c5f8d0131e2f45fb31da796d66b810d1a3dad1517",
      "text": "此乃我等心意之结晶！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_029_22:5_02_029_22_b:cmd-000035:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e76ca1c641e3b91fbc99b2b2921d2d1b3004c9ee3a2313288bfd70c6a0549eb0",
      "text": "阿斯兰先生、撒旦先生。非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_029_22:5_02_029_22_b:cmd-000036:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a47439261969db827d97b487a96d5fbc31e9d487ae2cc23611850b2f213f8f4",
      "text": "两位的这份心意，我心怀感激地收下了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_029_22:5_02_029_22_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d40d61dc43fd6ad88f3bb9b5692f7fc38e2cea1621c292aa4014850f7ba2b830",
      "text": "呼哈哈哈哈！看到主因欢喜而颤抖的模样，\n撒旦也深感满足。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_029_22:5_02_029_22_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d40d61dc43fd6ad88f3bb9b5692f7fc38e2cea1621c292aa4014850f7ba2b830",
      "text": "呼哈哈哈哈！看到主因欢喜而颤抖的模样，\n撒旦也深感满足。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_029_22:5_02_029_22_b:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e1f84ac4a507f61f91a66f1cf3211b0b07f79d4a0cb1316effb848f256a333b",
      "text": "在战乙女们的决战之日蒙汝赐予漆黑之暗缠绕的\n黑之宝玉之时，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_029_22:5_02_029_22_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84bab2f7d7c0844bf039d7516cb22294ea3522b954247a4717756b238bb08f10",
      "text": "我等因喜悦而颤栗的心绪与对汝之谢意，\n是否已借由此番之礼传达给你了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_029_22:5_02_029_22_b:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1595ccf5c00e1263ac169f44fc69d1b7b396badf12897171e9866a238445e6e",
      "text": "吾主啊，为了令光之民堕入黑暗之中，\n今后亦请继续助我一臂之力吧！哈——哈哈哈哈！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
